<%- include("header.ejs") %>
    <main>
        <div class="support-page">
            <div class="support-container main-block">
                <div class="collaborative-support-container support-page-block">
                    <div class="support-page-block-title">
                        <h2>Collaborative Support</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>
                            Everything I post on this site is work I've done individually, and 
                            I'm interested in having the support of others on the work I share. 
                            This can be in the form of simple feedback, working on a joint 
                            effort, or providing me with mentorship. I'm particularly interested 
                            in collaborating with others when it comes to my work on POTS. 
                            If you'd like to work with me on something, please email me at 
                            austin@austinwn.com. Please note, I don't check emails at that address 
                            every day.
                            <br>
                            <br>
                            Aditionally, I've coded this site from scratch, and am interested in 
                            any recommendations for improving it. You can view the code for the 
                            site on my github.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <div class="financial-support-container support-page-block">
                    <div class="support-page-block-title">
                        <h2>Financial Support</h2>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <p>
                            The work I do on this site isn't free, and I'm currently 
                            operating it at a loss. Outside of the hosting costs of the 
                            site, I also purchase textbooks, online learning sources, and 
                            various softwares for my research into POTS. If you find my work 
                            interesting and would like to help it continue, you can donate 
                            at my Patreon.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </main>
